# Quit and EOF cancel work and exit without requiring a pending bestmove.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# EOF without active work is a clean Phase-1 shell shutdown.
@phase 1.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
! close-stdin
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

@phase 4.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< position startpos
< go infinite searchmoves e2e4
! allow-info begin
! close-stdin
! exit 0 within 1000ms
! allow-info end
